[0;31m[15:17:26] CHAOS  [0m   • Capacity segment cache: falls back to CockroachDB reads.
[0;31m[15:17:26] CHAOS  [0m     Slightly slower but functionally correct.
[0;31m[15:17:26] CHAOS  [0m WHAT STAYS WORKING:
[0;31m[15:17:26] CHAOS  [0m   • All HTTP endpoints return 200 (Redis failure is transparent to callers)
[0;31m[15:17:26] CHAOS  [0m   • Reservations still succeed (locking uses CockroachDB SELECT FOR UPDATE)
[0;31m[15:17:26] CHAOS  [0m   • IAM JWKS endpoint (no Redis dependency)
